pi.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-13T23:05:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112744","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112744.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112744.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This greatly reduces PCK size for dedicated servers in projects that use either VoxelGI or LightmapGI for global illumination. Additionally, this prevents errors from being printed on export when using `--headless` to export a dedicated server PCK in a project that uses a VoxelGI node.\r\n\r\nThe same approach can be used to implement https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12748 later on.\r\n**Edit:** Done in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112773.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109145.\r\n- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109146#issuecomment-3529921042\r\nand https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103284.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_headless_voxelgi_export.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23535805/test_headless_voxelgi_export.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\nFile sizes are in bytes. The test project includes a LightmapGI node with 16 probe subdivisions and a VoxelGI node with 128 subdivisions.\r\n\r\nBefore this PR, both PCK/ZIPs would be the same size as the project doesn't include any textures.\r\n\r\n### PCK size\r\n\r\n```\r\n505140 /tmp/out.pck\r\n 42852 /tmp/out_server.pck\r\n```\r\n\r\n### ZIP size\r\n\r\n```\r\n329870 /tmp/out.zip\r\n 14608 /tmp/out_server.zip\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112744/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112744/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}